msgctxt "92"
msgid "Oh! Kiryu-san! What a coincidence!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "Wait... Kaede? I thought you were living in Tokyo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"Yeah. I loved working at that shop, too, but I've finally realized my "
"calling."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "What's that?"
msgstr "Cos'è?"

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"I want to manage an inn in Okinawa. It'll be a place\r\n"
"where the tired fathers of Tokyo can come and take\r\n"
"a load off."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "An inn? Where did that idea come from?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"The customers at Earth Angel said that Tokyo wasn't the\r\n"
"right place for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"They told me, \"Kaede-chan, you should go home to Okinawa\r\n"
"and start your own business.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid ""
"Wait, doesn't that mean that they don't think you're cut out\r\n"
"for Tokyo?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "Huh? I dunno about that."
msgstr "Eh. Non saprei."

msgctxt "212"
msgid ""
"When I told my customers about my idea, they all got super\r\n"
"excited and said they'd absolutely come visit me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"I believe them when they say that. I'll make a place where\r\n"
"the tired fathers of Tokyo can relax when they come to\r\n"
"Okinawa."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid ""
"Is that right? Not a bad idea to follow your heart and make your dreams come"
" true."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid ""
"And when I talked to Momiji-chan about it, she said that\r\n"
"we could do it together!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid ""
"You see, my family used to run their own inn, but a\r\n"
"bunch of hotels opened up in the same area, and they\r\n"
"had to close down..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid ""
"I know a lot about running an inn, so I should be able to\r\n"
"help Kaede-chan with hers. I'm sure it'll all go well if\r\n"
"we work together."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid ""
"An inn that serves the hard-working men of Tokyo...\r\n"
"That's not a bad idea."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid ""
"Still, if we want to get up and running, we're going to need\r\n"
"money. I wonder if we should take out a loan..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid ""
"That's true. I think you can get it started without\r\n"
"borrowing too much money, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "Huh? But how?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid ""
"Kaede, your friend's family used to run their own inn,\r\n"
"right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "Well, yeah."
msgstr "Beh, sì."

msgctxt "356"
msgid ""
"If there are hotels all around that area, that means it's\r\n"
"a good location."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid ""
"In that case, you can just remodel the old place to fit\r\n"
"your needs."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid "Oh, yeah! I never thought of that!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "Huh? You'd be okay with that, Momiji?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid ""
"It's totally fine! Plus, my parents can help us with it,\r\n"
"too!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid ""
"All right! Then the money I earned in Tokyo should be\r\n"
"more than enough!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid "Thank you, Kiryu-san! Man, you're so smart!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid "I don't know about that. I couldn't tell you if it'll work out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid ""
"I'm sure it will. I can't thank you enough. You've done so\r\n"
"much for me. Thanks to you, I've discovered my calling."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid ""
"Oh, I know! Here, take this. It's something I bought\r\n"
"in Tokyo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid "You got a <Color:8>Caviar Skin Bag<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid ""
"You've got to visit my inn once we open! You can stay for\r\n"
"free, of course."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid "See ya!"
msgstr "Ci vediamo!"

msgctxt "620"
msgid "You got 5,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

